{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1122697-pure-sovereigns-2e-first-draft","id":1122697,"title":"Pure Sovereigns 2e First Draft","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-30T07:10:53-07:00","id":1122697,"title":"Pure Sovereigns 2e First Draft","content":"I've had a crack at revising the Pure Sovereigns for 2nd Edition. This is only a first draft and I've skipped most of the fluff regarding the Legacy (since I don't envision it really changing from what's written in the Silver Ladder book), but I'd appreciate some critical feedback as to what needs changing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/09kzw8csfeqseqg/Pure%20Sovereigns.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/09kzw8csfeqseqg/Pure%20Sovereigns.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/09kzw8csfeqseqg/Pure%20Sovereigns.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.dropbox.com/s/09kzw8csfeqseqg/Pure%20Sovereigns.pdf?dl=0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8871-griffalo","name":"griffalo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8871_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-30T09:42:35-07:00","id":1122727,"title":"","content":"As I've got a pure Sovereign npcs coming up in my game this is nice to see. I like the way you deviate from standart Legacy protocol. The only once per hour restriction on the third attainment is uncessary though. In general active healing does not seem to be in theme for the legacy. Perhaps instead a passive bonus to the prior attainment improving the body control a little and adding 25 years to the life expectancy of the mage per life dot.<br /> <br /> The Regeneration part of the fith attainment can deviate a bit more from normal spells in my opinion. We're talking about a Gnosis 8 mage here afterall... I'd change it so that it can only affect yourself, but can completly regenerate any missing limb lastingly, making the body truly unmarrable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}